{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "70eb6ba0894e0dd112b8d70989218817dd42eb5223dba3a46f054de390513b42", "ja": "＜テキスト非表示＞", "zh": "＜不显示文本＞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "b7edda83e49fb38b8f163d6c91a8b4425733d1c926cb1343d7523d5af67c79c1", "ja": "私はただ、好きなことをしてるだけなんだけど……。\nううん、好きだからこそ、成長できてるのかも！", "zh": "我只是做自己喜欢的事而已……\n不对，说不定正因为喜欢，才能有所成长呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a930651b62c14113746b3af3a5f8ed73cb5a7447329667907ed63913849f0ccb", "ja": "青羽さん、ここに居ましたか！\nスタジオに向かうので、留守をお願いしたくて。", "zh": "青羽小姐，原来你在这里！\n我要去录音室，想请你帮忙留守一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "1c95fe585af98ed146aee510291d347039f478d72110668d51dfc08c341f5edb", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nこれから歩ちゃん達の収録でしたね。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n接下来要录制步她们的节目，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "74dcc01d2624b19a0a0b8f78e84641b09f95021c943b35b5ca0a60a5ec8d0f8d", "ja": "はい、急遽決まったアレです。すみません、\n青羽さんにも急いで衣装を作ってもらって……。", "zh": "是的，就是那个临时决定的安排。不好意思，还让青羽小姐赶着做了服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "5152b3bae4eb76fdfd1debfcf982d78a2bec5db494bdd31169db55e8839e5517", "ja": "いえ！　話を聞いた時は、確かに驚きましたけど、\nでも、おかげで私も成長できました♪", "zh": "不会！虽然刚听说的时候确实吓了一跳，\n但我也因此得到了成长♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "502b77073aafecc82d06f497814475256002c11be2bb2fc96c8b387aa7042d96", "ja": "おお、さすが青羽さん、なんてポジティブな……\nってもう行かないと！　とりあえず、失礼しますね！", "zh": "哦，不愧是青羽小姐，真是积极啊……\n啊，我得走了！总之，先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1008_se", "source_sha256": "6067586b6ee6ba9da8eec9ea2b642802924e13930c1f7af264199c4b54c7698d", "ja": "バタバタバタ……！", "zh": "啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "798dc43f8ce28f6c973be7a703cda69ac99d7a718354db098ecdcd2ef65ce58e", "ja": "行ってらっしゃーい！\nよーし。私もテレビの前で、みんなを応援しなきゃ！", "zh": "慢走——！\n好，我也得在电视机前为大家加油才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1010_null", "source_sha256": "4969da92a854a7f9ff9fa25a2445d465d993ed0290c03ae2a0afba12220aecab", "ja": "―音楽番組　本番直前―", "zh": "―音乐节目　正式开拍前―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "6cb22a4a76ba49ad2b73a7d42e33a54d1563c3617bf680cb7e57d74ef589d1ea", "ja": "収録本番前のこの緊張感、なんとも言えないね。\n現役の頃を思い出すよ。", "zh": "正式录音前的这种紧张感，真是难以形容。  \n让我想起了自己还在一线的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "d566181191dc2056927058dcea680925a79c4885df4821473aba241c368b8067", "ja": "ところで、彼はまだ来ていないのかい？\nもうすぐ始まるというのに。", "zh": "对了，他还没来吗？明明马上就要开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "edd8fa2b7f3a97dbd06adb16f38f984c0fde92f7cf0b9a66966f462dc85c48e6", "ja": "さっき劇場を出たって連絡がありましたよ。\nそろそろ……あっ、噂をすれば♪", "zh": "刚才联系说他已经离开剧场了。\n差不多该到了……啊，说曹操曹操到♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "afba306a5da74d64de4a0a43f5953a10da8a0c0b3708fda8e07d0df9a9759a6a", "ja": "お疲れ様です、社長、音無さん！\nふう、よかった……間に合ったみたいですね。", "zh": "辛苦了，社长，音无小姐！\n呼，太好了……看来赶上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "d9319aff3ba3e546d5fc94554d799765a44c0999d66bf95d8ddb50bd8e53e770", "ja": "おお、ギリギリだよ君～！　とはいえ、忙しい中でも\nきっちり現場にくるあたりは、さすがだ！", "zh": "哦，真是千钧一发啊～！不过，百忙之中还能准时赶到现场，不愧是你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "614998e8dabaed92ef67106665b3dad2c477396f88cebd68babfc8aeaa756eab", "ja": "同じ場所にいないと、わからないこともありますから。\n社長こそ、この企画をねじ込む手腕、さすがです！", "zh": "毕竟有些事情，不在现场是不会明白的。\n倒是社长您，能把这个企划硬塞进来的手腕，真不愧是您啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "a14278516b68ea9c4ef90afb81c967b17a9abc8f504e07b8129938b1a49c21c3", "ja": "ふふふ、ダンスを身近に感じられるようになった昨今、\nこのビッグウェーブに乗らない手はないからね！", "zh": "呵呵呵，如今舞蹈已经变得越来越贴近生活，当然不能错过这股大潮啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "b55722b7519b5118bb412474d6a22b7e1faddcb40cf2298f3d72b8987c46baf1", "ja": "社長は芸能界の荒波も、\nうまく乗りこなしてきましたからね～。……あら？", "zh": "社长在演艺圈的惊涛骇浪中，也一直游刃有余嘛～。……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "407357ae90840c560b93c67bfb6966f1fede4df34c0de5748a2adc1cc841f7ab", "ja": "なんだか空気がピリッとしてきました。\n撮影が始まるみたいです！", "zh": "不知不觉间，气氛变得紧张起来了。\n看来要开始拍摄了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1020_null", "source_sha256": "d7d68566962ec3cc98a3f94acd16d2387edf6cbab016ffd27950115485e8707b", "ja": "―音楽番組　放送開始―", "zh": "——音乐节目　开始播出——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1021_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "c2499cddb711dd4d59169dea12f61925d4348d47b6f5984a69bc0f20a45a8d6b", "ja": "というわけで、次の企画に登場するのは、\nこちらの皆さんでーす！", "zh": "所以，接下来企划的出演者就是——\n这几位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "101ccc224dd5177127e2ea8bc34ae1fe94bb083f95219c9b015abfebc1639ea1", "ja": "イェーイ！　アタシ達～、", "zh": "耶——！我们～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "95bf2b0460e07e7127010040d6258c7e8720b35857144ed4c40b187630207ffc", "ja": "miraclesonic★expassionでーす！", "zh": "我们是miraclesonic★expassion～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "95bf2b0460e07e7127010040d6258c7e8720b35857144ed4c40b187630207ffc", "ja": "miraclesonic★expassionでーす！", "zh": "我们是miraclesonic★expassion～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1025_018ele", "source_sha256": "95bf2b0460e07e7127010040d6258c7e8720b35857144ed4c40b187630207ffc", "ja": "miraclesonic★expassionでーす！", "zh": "我们是miraclesonic★expassion～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "95bf2b0460e07e7127010040d6258c7e8720b35857144ed4c40b187630207ffc", "ja": "miraclesonic★expassionでーす！", "zh": "我们是miraclesonic★expassion～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1027_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "101f3ef3f5bad5817f95ca588ad77809bbb4cf52ddb67fe2509ccdd13d1f7b64", "ja": "おお、みなさん元気ですね！　早速ですが、\n今回どんな企画に挑戦してくれたんですか？", "zh": "哦，大家都很有精神嘛！那么就马上进入正题，\n这次挑战了什么企划呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "bca1280b7960f9ce8111b331604f9062b8165d73c28dac0039b71dc5a853c36a", "ja": "えっと、ワタシ達ミラソニは、明るく元気っていうか、\n元気すぎるメンバーが集まったユニットなんだヨー！", "zh": "那个，我们Miracle Sonic这个组合呢，与其说是开朗有活力，不如说是聚集了一群活力过头的成员哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "df33c0da43e870126e16977fc5edc8961961a00e05ac41b97eef5a813dadec02", "ja": "私たちの元気で、みんなをもっと元気にしたーい！\nと思って、今回お手伝いしてくれる人を募集しました！", "zh": "我们想用自己的活力，让大家变得更有活力——！\n所以这次招募了愿意来帮忙的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1030_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "e7bb12f24e338e359ea9ddd80134cb7e2348d05d8e14d4beb9544f050d109e5b", "ja": "おお、それは楽しそうですね！\nそれで、決まったんですか？", "zh": "哦，听起来真有意思！\n那么，已经决定了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "bba06820d29695fef7c0f7b7cc6c82917370e1426e556aec6a2abc540345a28b", "ja": "はい！　今回お手伝いしてくれたのは、\n『美楽留（みらくる）高校』のダンス部さんです！", "zh": "是的！这次来帮忙的是\n『美乐留（奇迹）高中』的舞蹈部！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a91a9cb6455cdecdc22972c7bd6bd2aa1db2132becf0c7efda3acd771bd0a411", "ja": "おたよりに書いてくれたコメントも、すっごく熱くて。\nとにかく、早く映像を見てほしいって感じです！", "zh": "大家在来信中写下的评论也特别热情。总之就是，想让大家赶快看看影像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "c032f055f8778b33cb5b29a5bd3beaf35800e7a1025aff07103cba03f768f70f", "ja": "と、いうことで！　VTR～、", "zh": "所以说！录像——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "ad9390b81ee515623591092eba358575aa728fa1c3271ecfc63b2e4dbce94702", "ja": "スタート！！", "zh": "开始！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "a24ef4f45a1a5f3d9569edd207c52c5877961bfbd623df0863fa3adcb730cd68", "ja": "スタート☆", "zh": "开始☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9d142a19de8793628753ac168769f58c27de04d0e87bde4d953818aeb93ce7a8", "ja": "スタート♪", "zh": "开始♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0400_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0400_story_intro_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "ad9390b81ee515623591092eba358575aa728fa1c3271ecfc63b2e4dbce94702", "ja": "スタート！！", "zh": "开始！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
